or:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/2nHmMFMockCIGSmQEq7aeI/05dfe05f88bfdc57f3109e5dc65b3076/eef3e5a6-81b0-48fd-8912-79cb0ec7b4b2.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-1yio1fx\" data-testid=\"Text-h2\"><b>中国厂商主导二合市场，头部效应进一步强化</b></h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">中国厂商持续引领全球二合手游发展。2026年上半年，下载榜Top10中有6款产品来自中国，下载增长榜达到9款；收入增长榜Top10同样有9款来自中国厂商。从《Gossip Harbor》持续领跑，到《Tasty Travels》《Hollywood Merge》等新品快速崛起，中国厂商已形成覆盖成熟产品与潜力新品的完整产品梯队。同时，收入排名前三的产品贡献了全球二合手游约62%的收入，头部集中度进一步提升。</p><img id=\"tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q\" __typename=\"Media\" title=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg15)\" file=\"[object Object]\" alt=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg15)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-18d8yid-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/tBL3XaIJQZMIdjCBclU3q/7935395792344b2d05d847a45fef3ce2/35b3ec99-efda-49b2-89ef-98d4a4ae6cda.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-1yio1fx\" data-testid=\"Text-h2\"><b>高频LiveOps 推动二合手游持续增长</b></h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">随着市场进入成熟阶段，竞争重点正从获客转向长期运营。Sensor Tower旗下Playliner运营活动洞察平台数据显示，以《Gossip Harbor》为代表的头部产品持续提升LiveOps密度，月均活动数量已从2024年的约69个增长至2026年第二季度约244个，通过剧情、任务和限时活动不断创造新的资源消耗场景和玩家目标。相比之下，三合手游则保持更加稳定的活动节奏，更侧重核心玩家留存。这也反映出二合与三合逐渐形成了不同的长期运营模式。</p><img id=\"3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr\" __typename=\"Media\" title=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg32)\" file=\"[object Object]\" alt=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg32)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-18d8yid-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/3W9htUP2WOr3vjnf8GAQbr/228218b9501a63858fba3128e05f81d3/801e6b52-bd02-4532-b1bc-8db2b0f8f66c.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><h2 class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-h2 mui-1yio1fx\" data-testid=\"Text-h2\"><b>商业化持续深化，广告成为头部二合手游的重要补充收入来源</b></h2><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">随着二合手游用户规模持续扩大，头部产品正不断丰富商业化模式。应用内购买（IAP）仍是主要收入来源，但广告变现（IAA）正在成为重要的补充渠道。以《Tasty Travels》为例，其广告展示量随用户规模快速增长，在美国、日本、印度和巴西等市场均建立了稳定的广告库存。除游戏广告外，Temu、SHEIN 等电商平台也持续投放，显示头部二合手游正凭借庞大的用户规模吸引更多非游戏广告预算，进一步提升用户生命周期价值（LTV）。与此同时，2026年上半年二合手游下载榜Top10中，以IAP为主要收入来源的产品占比已提升至80%，高于2025年同期的60%，反映头部产品正通过 <b>IAP + IAA</b> 的组合商业化模式持续提升变现能力。</p><img id=\"1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W\" __typename=\"Media\" title=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg29)\" file=\"[object Object]\" alt=\"[PDF]2026 合成手游洞察(pg29)\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-asset-block\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"mui-18d8yid-Image-root-Media-root\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 50vw\" srcSet=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=384&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 384w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=640&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 640w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=750&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 750w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=828&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 828w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=1080&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1080w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=1200&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1200w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=1920&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 1920w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=2048&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 2048w, https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40 3840w\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/vfkpgemp7ek3/1swDMwiKpqE22ENXcDLg4W/c00a5a5e4dafc12fcd6a10c2cf964d95/Screenshot_2026-08-04_at_10.15.38.png?w=3840&amp;fm=webp&amp;q=40\"/><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">Sensor Tower《2026年全球合成手游市场洞察报告》还将深入解析：</p><ul><li><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">全球合成手游市场规模、增长趋势及竞争格局</p></li><li><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">二合与三合手游的发展路径及运营策略差异</p></li><li><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">头部合成手游的下载、收入、用户规模及市场表现</p></li><li><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">全球主要市场、用户画像、受众重叠及广告投放洞察</p></li><li><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">《Gossip Harbor》《Tasty Travels》等头部产品的 LiveOps、经济系统与商业化策略</p></li></ul><p class=\"MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 mui-v4j50s\" data-testid=\"Text-body1\">下载完整报告，深入了解二合手游如何通过用户增长策略、组合变现模式与长期用户经营，成为全球解谜游戏市场最重要的增长引擎，同时探索三合手游在成熟市场中的长期运营策略。</p><div class=\"MuiBox-root mui-1sf3xto\" data-testid=\"Text-embedded-entry-block\"><a href=\"https://sensortower-china.com/zh-CN/report/state-of-merge-games-2026-china\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"4o0833fXQ8mvZ0dg0XDRsw\" color=\"primary\"><button class=\"MuiButtonBase-root MuiButton-root MuiButton-contained MuiButton-sizeMedium MuiButton-colorPrimary mui-eyhyh0\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" id=\"4o0833fXQ8mvZ0dg0XDRsw\">立即下载完整报告</button></a></div><br/></div><hr class=\"MuiDivider-root MuiDivider-fullWidth mui-u9hvpc\"/>", "content_sha1": "d013ca3e059c196a04a26e6414a7315ba596fbd9", "fetch_status": "ok", "body_status": "full", "fallback": "none", "saved_at": "2026-08-05T00:15:05+00:00", "extra": {}}
